* In [[1486 DR]], the city of [[Marsember]] was evacuated due to [[Netheril]]'s invasion of [[Cormyr]].<ref name="Sent-p6">{{Cite book/The Sentinel/Hardcover|6}}</ref> Grand Duke [[Farnig Seasilver]] was slain,<ref name="Sent-p59">{{Cite book/The Sentinel/Hardcover|59}}</ref> and Grand Duchess [[Elira Seasilver|Elira]] was captured at sea by [[Yder Tanthul]].<ref name="Sent-p70">{{Cite book/The Sentinel/Hardcover|70}}</ref>

